# Docker reads only the .dockerignore at the build-context root, so this file repeats the
# secret rules of the repository's root .dockerignore (CLAUDE.md). Keep them in sync.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Generated or local-only
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.vite
**/*.log
**/*.local
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
